  "question": {
    "text": "The aperture of the objective is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>24</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. The resolving power of this telescope, if a light of wavelength <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2440</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></mover></math> is used to see the object will be"
  },
  "options": [
    {
